{
 "subtitle": "The goal-manager family (v1-v1.3, v2) and the plain baselines: 1.1M env steps each, size50m, scored on the same 30 fixed worlds with tools/death_eval.py. Honest runs first; [masked] runs read the game's action rules and count as cheating. Rows with several training seeds show seed 0. Updated 2026-11-08.",
 "summary": "Every number is the mean episode-final achievement count over 30 evaluation episodes, ± its standard error over those worlds; unlock rates are the share of episodes in which an achievement fired; return is the mean raw Craftax return as a % of the maximum (226). Every checkpoint is scored on the same fixed worlds (env.reseed, audit B05), so comparisons are paired world by world. The error bars cover the worlds only, not training seeds; a 30-world score moves by about ±0.55 between world sets, so a gap under ~1.1 between two single runs is not evidence.\nHonest runs (no rule mask): plain 4.77 (two seeds: 4.77 / 4.77); plain + RSSM-2 memory + the v1.2 manager 5.77 (seed 1: 5.30; two-seed mean 5.53, +0.77 ± 0.22 over plain, +0.20 ± 0.24 over RSSM-2 alone, which scores 5.33 on family/rssm2); fixed v1.2 without the mask 6.03 (6.13 ± 0.22 over 60 worlds, +0.33 ± 0.40 over the honest map it is built on). v2 without the mask (v2_norules) was trained but not scored: it ends training at 4.78 achievements per episode (last 100k steps), below plain (5.43).\nMasked runs (counted as cheating; B2 rule mask on): v1 7.33, v1.1 9.40, v1.2 9.97, v1.3 9.17 (old code); v1.2 retrained on the fixed RSSM-2 code 8.77 (three seeds 8.77 / 8.83 / 8.73; 9.03 over 60 worlds); v2 6.93, v2-cur 6.53, v2 fixed 7.17 (seeds 7.17 / 7.83 / 6.07). The mask is worth +2.90 ± 0.26 under the v1.2 manager (60 worlds), as much as without a manager.",
 "table_note": "ach. ± SE = mean episode-final achievements ± standard error over the 30 worlds (one training seed). w/o wake = the same minus WAKE_UP. life = mean lifespan in steps. return = raw Craftax return, % of 226. Rates are % of episodes. Vanilla DreamerV3: the original checkpoint (code before the 2026-10 fixes), re-scored. Plain: main's code. +manager: plain + RSSM-2 as a memory + the v1.2 manager (13 named goals, shared critic, hold 32), no mask, no shaping. v1.2 no mask: fixed v1.2 (map-target RSSM-2, potential shaping) minus the rule mask and the validity flags. [masked] rows use the B2 rule mask: v1-v1.3 on the old code (RSSM-2 bugs, docs/design-manager.md); v2 and v2-cur learned goals, curiosity, RSSM-2 memory (docs/design-v2.md); \"fixed RSSM-2\" rows were retrained on the code of the 2026-10-11 audit.",
